"""STM32H723ZET6: Arm Cortex-M7 MCU, 550 MHz, 512 KB flash, LQFP144 (20 x 20 mm), -40 to 85 degC.
GENERATED from component.toml by `python3 -m lib.zen`; do not edit. Source of truth: component.toml and
calc.py (numbers, cites, equations). DS: https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/stm32h723ze.pdf, DS13313 Rev 5 (2025-05).
Checks are DC steady-state on the voltages each instance declares. They do not cover transients, overshoot,
hot-plug ringing or load dump. A checked net with no declared voltage reports UNVERIFIED (a warning).
Analysis (worst case, tables, plots) is done in Python: see README.md and calc.py."""

load("@stdlib/units.zen", "Temperature")

# UNCHECKED: abs_vin_ft: Input voltage on FT_xxx pins (DS p.88, Table 9. Voltage characteristics, Input voltage on FT_xxx pins); GPIO: bidirectional, direction set by firmware; FT/TT limits in the data; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_vin_tt: Input voltage on TT_xx pins (DS p.88, Table 9. Voltage characteristics, Input voltage on TT_xx pins); GPIO: bidirectional, direction set by firmware; FT/TT limits in the data; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_delta_vdd: Variations between different VDDX power pins of the same domain (DS p.88, Table 9. Voltage characteristics, |DeltaVDDX|); magnitude rating between pins (board layout), not a single-pin voltage; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_delta_vss: Variations between all the different ground pins (DS p.88, Table 9. Voltage characteristics, |VSSx - VSS|); magnitude rating between ground pins (board layout), not a single-pin voltage; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_sum_vdd: Total current into sum of all VDD power lines (source) (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, SUM IVDD (note 1)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_sum_vss: Total current out of sum of all VSS ground lines (sink) (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, SUM IVSS (note 1)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_vdd_pin: Maximum current into each VDD power pin (source) (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, IVDD (note 1)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_vss_pin: Maximum current out of each VSS ground pin (sink) (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, IVSS (note 1)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_io: Output current sunk or sourced by any I/O and control pin, except Pxy_C (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, IIO (row 1)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_io_pxyc: Output current sunk or sourced by Pxy_C pins (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, IIO (row 2, Pxy_C)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_sum_sink: Total output current sunk by sum of all I/Os and control pins (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, SUM I(PIN) sunk (note 2)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_sum_source: Total output current sourced by sum of all I/Os and control pins (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, SUM I(PIN) sourced (note 2)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_inj_pin: Injected current on FT_xxx, TT_xx, RST and B pins except PA4, PA5 (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, IINJ(PIN) (notes 3, 4)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_inj_pa4_pa5: Injected current on PA4, PA5 (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, IINJ(PIN) PA4, PA5 (notes 3, 4)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_i_inj_sum: Total injected current (sum of all I/Os and control pins) (DS p.89, Table 10. Current characteristics, SUM IINJ(PIN) (note 5)); current rating, not a voltage check; owner: module
# UNCHECKED: abs_tstg: Storage temperature range (DS p.89, Table 11. Thermal characteristics, TSTG); owner: assembly (storage)
